<title>USA: Holmes Protection trades on Nasdaq under &quot;HLMS&quot;.</title>
<headline>Holmes Protection trades on Nasdaq under &quot;HLMS&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holmes Protection Group Inc said on Monday that it received approval to trade its common stock on the Nasdaq National Market under the symbol &quot;HLMS.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said in a release that prior to the approval, effective Monday, common stock traded on the Nasdaq Smallcap market and on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
